          "h1": "What they do",
          "intro": [
            {
              "claimIds": [
                "dbd45874-4105-4b92-90a0-956ec615fe9f"
              ],
              "text": "Zafran sells an AI-native exposure management platform for security teams that cuts through vulnerability noise, reveals what is truly exploitable, and automates mitigation and remediation using existing security controls. Its stated mission is to proactively stop the exploitation of vulnerabilities everywhere."
            },
            {
              "claimIds": [
