                "41cd0cd6-a36f-41f8-ba39-10876f5c5c81",
                "dd9536e8-73e7-45e8-937f-84da05f410b5",
                "1f6fec87-8bb6-4e79-ba16-be760d23bf6e"
              ],
              "text": "Founded in 2022, Zafran is headquartered in New York, New York, and has 167 employees. It has raised $130.5 million across four rounds from nine investors, including a $60 million Series C announced on 2 December 2025. Named customers include Kraft Heinz and Chipotle."
            }
          ],
